  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Touch Me I'm Going to Scream**: rare: 14 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2022-09-16.Microtech_Gefell_M210_flac24** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 21 songs; 133 min [1]\n- **mmj2022-09-16.dpa.16bit**: source not stated; 21 songs; 133 min [3]\n- **mmj2022-09-16.dpa**: source not stated; 21 songs; 133 min [4]\n- **mmj2022-09-16**: audience recording; 22 songs; 133 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- An intoxicated audience member knocked the recording mic stand down during this song [3]\n- An inebriated audience member knocked the taper's mic stand over while this song was being played [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2022-09-16.Microtech_Gefell_M210_flac24**: taped by John Lynch; transferred by Andy Murray; source: Microtech Gefell M210>Sound Devices mixpre6ii 24bit/48khz by the sbd [1]\n- **mmj2022-09-16.dpa.16bit**: taped by Matt Falise; source: DPA 4022 (ORTF)>AERCO MP2>Marantz PMD661 (WMOD) [3]. Also: Recorded near the soundboard, almost front-center, with DPA 4022 mics in ORTF on an 8-foot stand, via AERCO MP2 into Marantz PMD-661 [3]\n- **mmj2022-09-16.dpa**: taped by Matt Falise; source: DPA 4022 (ORTF)>AERCO MP2>Maratnz PMD-661 (WMOD) [4]. Also: Recorded near the soundboard, almost front-center, with DPA 4022 mics in ORTF on an 8-foot stand, via AERCO MP2 into Marantz PMD-661 [4]\n- **mmj2022-09-16**: taped by larryrulz; source: master audience recording [2]",
